{
 "about": "Sumi Koi sound set v3 (2026-11-28): modern casino with a Japanese touch. Every sound is cut and layered from real recordings or hand-made game sounds in free CC0 packs (Kenney, OpenGameArt, VCSL, VSCO 2 CE; see CREDITS-sound.md). No AI-generated audio. Loops (loop: true) are seamless when played from a decoded buffer (Web Audio, AudioBufferSourceNode.loop).",
 "key": "B hirajoshi (B C# D F# G), A = 440 Hz. koto_1..7 = glockenspiel D6 F#6 G6 B6 C#7 D7 F#7 (win ladder by cup value); bell_1..4 = tubular bell F#5 B5 D6 F#6 (multiplier climb); reel_stop_1..3 = B5 D6 F#6; music_base and music_fever are in the same key, so every ladder note fits both.",
 "format": "webm = Opus 48 kHz (mono 48 kbps, stereo 64 kbps); mp4 = AAC-LC (mono 64 kbps, stereo 96 kbps, ambience 80 kbps). The webm copies are kept in sound/webm; the game loads the mp4 files.",
